    {
      "beat_id": "B02",
      "act": "WHAT THIS IS",
      "narration_text": "Hi, this is Tanmay Kulkarni, in for Humanitarians AI. This week I contributed to Mycroft, which is both a book and a working repository for finance pipelines. It calls them recipes. Two of them sit behind this dashboard. One fetches the prices and does the math. The other calls it and draws the screen. My pull request, now merged, added checks to both, and rebuilt the math step so it runs on test data. Every price you'll see is invented, for testing. Morning one.",
